  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[C#] [C] [C#] [C] [C#] [C] [C#] [C#]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[D5]Thought it was easy to fall in love but [E5] [A] [D5]U U U\n[D5]You are different, this much I know, yeah [E5] [A]U U U\n[G]It might be your guile, it could be your [A]mind\n[B5]It might be the way you take your [E]time, oh [A] [D5]U U U\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D5] [E5] [G5] [A5]U, it's U, it's U U U (x2)\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[D5]I never know how much to say with [E5] [A] [D5]U U U\n[D5]I'd like to go deep but is it safe with [E5] [A]U U U\n[G]It might be your needs, it could be your [A]eyes\n[B5]It might be the way you sym[E]pathize, oh [A] [D5]U U U\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D5] [E5] [G5] [A5]U, it's U, it's U U U (x2)\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[D5]You break laws and pay no [E5]fines\n[G5]You get yours and then get [A]mine\n[D5]I don't think it's easy to stay in love, [E5]but [A] [D5]U U U\n\n{section: Outro}\n[D5] [E5] [G5] [A5] (x2)\nFinal em [A5]"
